      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "# Getting Started with CloudScale Stream API\n# Prerequisites\n# Authentication\n# Making Your First Request\n# Next Steps\n*   Register for an account at cloudscale.io to generate your unique API key.\n*   Copy your key securely and store it in your environment variables.\n*   Use the `Authorization: Bearer <your-key>` header in all subsequent requests.\n*   Send a GET request to `/api/v1/stream` to retrieve your initial data payload.\n*   Handle the JSON response by parsing the `data` field for immediate processing.\n*   Monitor your dashboard for usage limits and billing information updates.",
